  "description": "High-performance Plugin Trace Log Viewer & Real-time Execution Profiler for Microsoft Dataverse and Dynamics 365. Features Transaction Waterfall Timelines grouped by correlation ID, Live Log Streaming ('Tail -f' mode), Full-Text & Regex search across message blocks, Exception Call Stack Demangler, latency percentiles (P50/P95/P99), Infinite Loop & Depth Recursion Detector, 1-Click Replay Profile Exporter, Root-Cause Fix Advisor, Execution Diff Comparator, and Storage Cleanup.",
